/**
 * @defgroup fel_runtime Program and timestep
 * @brief Entry point, distributed initialization, PIC loop and diagnostics.
 *
 * Start with main() and FreeElectronLaserManager. Its lifecycle is inherited
 * from IPPL BaseManager; the student guide explains the exact call order.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup fel_config Configuration and units
 * @brief JSON schema, parser checks and conversion to internal simulation units.
 *
 * Read config and read_config() before changing an input value. The FEL uses
 * scaled internal units; the ChDR mesh constructor instead uses SI metres.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup fel_fields Mesh, fields and solver selection
 * @brief Uniform Cartesian layout, vector field types and the active solver alias.
 *
 * FELFieldContainer owns source and electromagnetic fields. The solver owns
 * its three potential time levels. Its implementation is in IPPL's
 * src/MaxwellSolvers, outside this focused documentation's input list.
 * See @ref fel_mathematics for the exact stencil, field reconstruction and boundaries.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup fel_particles Particles and initialization
 * @brief Distributed particle attributes and host-side MITHRA bunch generation.
 *
 * The manager generates the bunch on rank zero, assigns charge and mass per
 * actual generated particle, centres it and redistributes it through IPPL.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup fel_physics Frame transforms and external field
 * @brief Lorentz transforms and the analytic static-undulator model.
 *
 * These helpers support the active z-directed moving frame. Their comments
 * distinguish general-looking interfaces from the directions actually supported.
 */
